iMask 2.0

The VideoCall Picture in Picture architecture and content-only profile reference
the following projects and authors:

Original project: https://github.com/CaiWanFeng/PiP
Original author: CaiWanFeng

Current reference project: https://github.com/Yoroin/GlobalRefresh-PiP
Maintainer: Yoroin
Reference commit: 1b62341c1d62308962fb3656192d6783631aa00c

Referenced parameters include a 300-point content width, 0.1-point minimized
height, 44-point compact height, 60 FPS content updates, and a 2.4-second
content animation cycle. iMask has its own SwiftUI interface and rendering view.

Please retain attribution to CaiWanFeng and Yoroin and the corresponding links
when modifying or distributing software based on these projects.
